apiSurface:
Primary entry points:
- `npm install crawlee playwright` (or puppeteer/cheerio)
- `import { PlaywrightCrawler, Dataset, RequestQueue, RequestList, Router, Configuration } from 'crawlee'`

Typical usage:
```ts
const crawler = new PlaywrightCrawler({
  requestHandler: async ({ page, request, enqueueLinks, log, pushData }) => {
    await pushData({ title: await page.title(), url: request.url });
    await enqueueLinks();
  },
  maxRequestsPerCrawl: 100,
  maxRequestRetries: 3,
});
await crawler.run(['https://example.com']);
```

Router pattern for complex routing:
```ts
const router = createPlaywrightRouter();
router.addHandler('detail', async ({ page }) => { ... });
router.addDefaultHandler(async ({ page }) => { ... });
const crawler = new PlaywrightCrawler({ requestHandler: router });
```

